      "title": "等待整棵树收敛",
      "node": "loader",
      "code": "app-boot",
      "detail": "`boot()` 在 `ctx.loader.await()` 返回后才结束；`runProfile()` 再检查 fiber 仍是 ACTIVE 且 loader 存在，才提交 AppReady。任何一步失败都会 dispose 已启动的资源并走 fail-loud。",
      "input": "loader 树",
      "output": "AppReady committed",
      "event": "",
      "files": [
        {
          "path": "packages/boot/app-boot/src/index.ts",
